    "bookId": "g4a",
    "unit": "Unit 2 What time do you get up?",
    "sourceLine": 28,
    "sourceText": "*   Dongdong, it's 7:30 now. It's time to have breakfast.（冬冬，现在7点半了。该吃早饭了。）",
    "english": "Dongdong, it's 7:30 now. It's time to have breakfast.",
    "chinese": "冬冬，现在7点半了。该吃早饭了。",
    "section": "sentence"
