    "bookId": "g4a",
    "unit": "Unit 2 What time do you get up?",
    "sourceLine": 31,
    "sourceText": "*   Hi, Tim and Dino. It's time for breakfast.（你好，蒂姆和迪诺。该吃早饭了。）",
