    "bookId": "g4a",
    "unit": "Unit 3 I like dumplings",
    "sourceLine": 52,
    "sourceText": "*   I like rice. My cat likes fish. He has fish for breakfast.（我喜欢米饭。我的猫喜欢鱼。他早饭吃鱼。）",
    "english": "I like rice. My cat likes fish. He has fish for breakfast.",
