    "sourceLine": 126,
    "sourceText": "*   We know the total. It's one hundred. There are five numbers here. We know four: fifteen, twenty-three, twenty-six and twenty-seven. What is the missing number?（我们知道总数。是一百。这里有五个数字。我们知道四个：15、23、26和27。缺失的数字是多少？）",
    "english": "We know the total. It's one hundred. There are five numbers here. We know four: fifteen, twenty-three, twenty-six and twenty-seven. What is the missing number?",
