    "unit": "Unit 5 She helps students",
    "sourceLine": 134,
    "sourceText": "*   Miss Li is our teacher. She gets to school early in the morning. She teaches English.（李老师是我们的老师。她早上很早到校。她教英语。）",
    "english": "Miss Li is our teacher. She gets to school early in the morning. She teaches English.",
    "chinese": "李老师是我们的老师。她早上很早到校。她教英语。",
