    "sourceText": "*   I learn English on Tuesdays and Wednesdays. Benny learns English on Tuesdays and Wednesdays.（我在星期二和星期三学英语。本尼在星期二和星期三学英语。）",
    "english": "I learn English on Tuesdays and Wednesdays. Benny learns English on Tuesdays and Wednesdays.",
