    "bookId": "g4b",
    "unit": "Unit 10 What does that sign mean?",
    "sourceLine": 202,
    "sourceText": "*   Tim, there is a park. No, Dino. That is not a park.（蒂姆，这儿有个公园。不，迪诺。那不是公园。）",
    "english": "Tim, there is a park. No, Dino. That is not a park.",
    "chinese": "蒂姆，这儿有个公园。不，迪诺。那不是公园。",
