    "bookId": "g4b",
    "unit": "Unit 6 What's your favourite season?",
    "sourceLine": 298,
    "sourceText": "*   I'm from Beijing. I like autumn. It is cool in autumn in Beijing.（我来自北京。我喜欢秋天。北京的秋天很凉爽。）",
