    "bookId": "g4b",
    "unit": "Unit 6 What's your favourite season?",
    "sourceLine": 299,
    "sourceText": "*   I'm from Sanya. I don't like summer. It's hot in Sanya.（我来自三亚。我不喜欢夏天。三亚很热。）",
