    "unit": "Unit 6 What's your favourite season?",
    "sourceLine": 300,
    "sourceText": "*   I'm from Kunming. I like winter in Kunming. It's not cold.（我来自昆明。我喜欢昆明的冬天。那里不冷。）",
    "english": "I'm from Kunming. I like winter in Kunming. It's not cold.",
