    "unit": "Unit 10 What does that sign mean?",
    "sourceLine": 352,
    "sourceText": "*   It means \"No swimming\". / No smoking. / No spitting. / Do not pick flowers. / No fishing.（它的意思是“禁止游泳”。 / 禁止吸烟。 / 禁止随地吐痰。 / 不要摘花。 / 禁止钓鱼。）",
    "english": "It means \"No swimming\". / No smoking. / No spitting. / Do not pick flowers. / No fishing.",
