    "unit": "Unit 10 What does that sign mean?",
    "sourceLine": 357,
    "sourceText": "*   Then they go to a cinema. They see a sign. It says \"No pets\". \"Am I a pet?\" Dino asks. \"No. You're my friend!\" Tim answers.（然后他们去了一家电影院。他们看到一个标志。上面写着“禁止宠物入内”。“我是一只宠物吗？”迪诺问。“不，你是我的朋友！”蒂姆回答。）",
