    "sourceText": "*   Lingling has dinner with her father and mother. Her dog sits under the table. \"Do you want some noodles, Lingling?\" her mother asks.（玲玲和她的爸爸妈妈一起吃晚饭。她的狗坐在桌子下面。“你想要一些面条吗，玲玲？”她的妈妈问。）",
