    "bookId": "g5a",
    "unit": "Unit 8 Lingling helps her parents",
    "sourceLine": 99,
    "sourceText": "*   Lingling often helps her parents at home.（玲玲经常在家里帮助她的父母。）",
    "english": "Lingling often helps her parents at home.",
    "chinese": "玲玲经常在家里帮助她的父母。",
