    "bookId": "g5a",
    "unit": "Unit 8 Lingling helps her parents",
    "sourceLine": 100,
    "sourceText": "*   Her mother makes the bed. She helps her.（她的妈妈整理床铺。她帮助她。）",
    "english": "Her mother makes the bed. She helps her.",
    "chinese": "她的妈妈整理床铺。她帮助她。",
