    "sourceText": "*   Do you like playing chess? No, I don't. I like collecting old photos.（你喜欢下象棋吗？不，我不喜欢。我喜欢收集老照片。）",
    "english": "Do you like playing chess? No, I don't. I like collecting old photos.",
    "chinese": "你喜欢下象棋吗？不，我不喜欢。我喜欢收集老照片。",
