    "id": "sen_g5b_1118",
    "bookId": "g5b",
    "unit": "Unit 12",
    "sourceLine": 520,
    "sourceText": "*   — We're going to listen to interesting stories / do some research.（我们要听有趣的故事/做一些研究。）",
    "english": "We're going to listen to interesting stories / do some research.",
    "chinese": "我们要听有趣的故事/做一些研究。",
