    "bookId": "g6a",
    "unit": "Unit 1 What did you do during the holidays?",
    "sourceLine": 12,
    "sourceText": "*   Last week, Tim and Dino played an interesting game in class. (上周，蒂姆和迪诺在课上玩了一个有趣的游戏。)",
