    "bookId": "g6a",
    "unit": "Unit 1 What did you do during the holidays?",
    "sourceLine": 14,
    "sourceText": "*   Tim said, \"Simon says, 'Sit down!'\" Dino sat down. (蒂姆说：“西蒙说，‘坐下！’”迪诺坐下了。)",
    "english": "Tim said, \"Simon says, 'Sit down!'\" Dino sat down.",
