    "bookId": "g6a",
    "unit": "Unit 1 What did you do during the holidays?",
    "sourceLine": 16,
    "sourceText": "*   The bell rang. Tim and Dino went out of the classroom. (铃响了。蒂姆和迪诺走出了教室。)",
    "english": "The bell rang. Tim and Dino went out of the classroom.",
    "chinese": "铃响了。蒂姆和迪诺走出了教室。",
