    "bookId": "g6a",
    "unit": "Unit 1 What did you do during the holidays?",
    "sourceLine": 18,
    "sourceText": "*   And then Tim said to Dino, \"Simon says, 'Run around the tree!'\" But Dino didn't. (然后蒂姆对迪诺说：“西蒙说，‘绕着树跑！’”但是迪诺没有跑。)",
