    "bookId": "g6a",
    "unit": "Unit 1 What did you do during the holidays?",
    "sourceLine": 19,
    "sourceText": "*   \"Why didn't you run around the tree?\" asked Tim. Dino said, \"Class is over!\" (“你为什么不绕着树跑？”蒂姆问。迪诺说：“下课了！”)",
    "english": "\"Why didn't you run around the tree?\" asked Tim. Dino said, \"Class is over!\"",
