    "bookId": "g6a",
    "unit": "Unit 2 Katie always gets up early",
    "sourceLine": 23,
    "sourceText": "*   Her family often has breakfast at 6:45 a.m. (她的家人经常在早上6:45吃早饭。)",
    "english": "Her family often has breakfast at 6:45 a.m.",
    "chinese": "她的家人经常在早上6:45吃早饭。",
    "section": "sentence"
