    "bookId": "g6a",
    "unit": "Unit 2 Katie always gets up early",
    "sourceLine": 25,
    "sourceText": "*   Katie returns home at 5:00 p.m. She often does her homework before dinner. She plays chess with her father after dinner. (凯蒂下午5:00回家。她经常在晚饭前做作业。晚饭后她和爸爸下国际象棋。)",
    "english": "Katie returns home at 5:00 p.m. She often does her homework before dinner. She plays chess with her father after dinner.",
