    "bookId": "g6a",
    "unit": "Unit 2 Katie always gets up early",
    "sourceLine": 30,
    "sourceText": "*   Yesterday, he saw a few beautiful birds. They sang very well. He could not name them. (昨天，他看到了几只美丽的鸟。它们唱得很好。他叫不出它们的名字。)",
    "english": "Yesterday, he saw a few beautiful birds. They sang very well. He could not name them.",
    "chinese": "昨天，他看到了几只美丽的鸟。它们唱得很好。他叫不出它们的名字。",
