    "bookId": "g6a",
    "unit": "Unit 2 Katie always gets up early",
    "sourceLine": 31,
    "sourceText": "*   Now he is waiting for them to come again. He is going to observe them and take photos of them. (现在他正等着它们再来。他打算观察它们并给它们拍照。)",
    "english": "Now he is waiting for them to come again. He is going to observe them and take photos of them.",
