    "unit": "Unit 3 I like my computer",
    "sourceLine": 34,
    "sourceText": "*   Dad, thank you. I like my computer. It's very fast. It will help you a lot. (爸爸，谢谢你。我喜欢我的电脑。它非常快。它会对你有很大帮助。)",
