    "bookId": "g6a",
    "unit": "Unit 3 I like my computer",
    "sourceLine": 35,
    "sourceText": "*   Great! I saw an interesting bird in a book yesterday. Now I can search for a lot of things about it. (太棒了！昨天我在书里看到了一只有趣的鸟。现在我可以搜索很多关于它的信息。)",
    "english": "Great! I saw an interesting bird in a book yesterday. Now I can search for a lot of things about it.",
