    "bookId": "g6a",
    "unit": "Unit 3 I like my computer",
    "sourceLine": 38,
    "sourceText": "*   He could email his friends in Australia. He could do his homework on the computer, too. (他可以给他在澳大利亚的朋友发电子邮件。他也可以在电脑上做作业。)",
