    "bookId": "g6a",
    "unit": "Unit 3 I like my computer",
    "sourceLine": 39,
    "sourceText": "*   Dongdong wanted to learn drawing and painting on the computer. Peter taught him. (冬冬想在电脑上学习画画和涂色。彼得教了他。)",
