    "bookId": "g6a",
    "unit": "Unit 9 This bird is bigger than the first one",
    "sourceLine": 113,
    "sourceText": "*   Once there were three big birds in a forest. They were Bob, Baker and Ben. (从前在森林里有三只大鸟。它们是鲍勃、贝克和本。)",
    "english": "Once there were three big birds in a forest. They were Bob, Baker and Ben.",
    "chinese": "从前在森林里有三只大鸟。它们是鲍勃、贝克和本。",
    "section": "sentence"
