    "bookId": "g6a",
    "unit": "Unit 9 This bird is bigger than the first one",
    "sourceLine": 114,
    "sourceText": "*   Baker was bigger than Bob, but smaller than Ben. (贝克比鲍勃大，但比本小。)",
