    "bookId": "g6a",
    "unit": "Unit 9 This bird is bigger than the first one",
    "sourceLine": 116,
    "sourceText": "*   There were three small birds in the forest. They were Jane, Judy and Julia. (森林里有三只小鸟。它们是简、朱迪和朱莉娅。)",
    "english": "There were three small birds in the forest. They were Jane, Judy and Julia.",
