    "bookId": "g6a",
    "unit": "Unit 9 This bird is bigger than the first one",
    "sourceLine": 118,
    "sourceText": "*   One day, the birds decided to sing together. A lot of people listened to them and said, \"They are really the best singers in the forest!\" (一天，鸟儿们决定一起唱歌。很多人听了它们唱歌，说：“它们真的是森林里最好的歌手！”)",
    "english": "One day, the birds decided to sing together. A lot of people listened to them and said, \"They are really the best singers in the forest!\"",
