    "bookId": "g6a",
    "unit": "Unit 10 I don't feel well today",
    "sourceLine": 121,
    "sourceText": "*   What's wrong with you? I don't feel well. I feel cold and I have a cough. (你怎么了？我感觉不舒服。我感觉冷，而且咳嗽。)",
