    "sourceText": "*   You can't go to school. Just have a good rest. Thank you, doctor. (你不能去上学了。就好好休息吧。谢谢医生。)",
    "english": "You can't go to school. Just have a good rest. Thank you, doctor.",
    "chinese": "你不能去上学了。就好好休息吧。谢谢医生。",
