    "id": "sen_g6a_1246",
    "bookId": "g6a",
    "unit": "Unit 10 I don't feel well today",
    "sourceLine": 126,
    "sourceText": "*   Later, he didn't feel well. He felt cold and had a headache. He coughed and coughed. (后来，他感觉不舒服。他觉得冷，头痛。他咳了又咳。)",
