    "bookId": "g6b",
    "unit": "Unit 6 Anne wanted to dance",
    "sourceLine": 95,
    "sourceText": "*   Lingling was dancing in the dancing room. Anne watched her. Anne wanted to dance like Lingling.（玲玲正在舞蹈室跳舞。安妮看着她。安妮想和玲玲一样跳舞。）",
