    "id": "sen_g6b_1382",
    "bookId": "g6b",
    "unit": "Unit 6 Anne wanted to dance",
    "sourceLine": 96,
    "sourceText": "*   \"Wow! Lingling! You can dance very well,\" said Anne. \"Can you teach me?\"（“哇！玲玲！你跳得真好，”安妮说。“你能教我吗？”）",
