    "bookId": "g6b",
    "unit": "Unit 6 Anne wanted to dance",
    "sourceLine": 98,
    "sourceText": "*   \"Now, put your arms out like this. Listen to the music and move your legs with the music. It's easy and fun,\" said Lingling.（“现在，像这样伸出你的双臂。听音乐，跟着音乐移动你的腿。这很容易且有趣，”玲玲说。）",
    "english": "\"Now, put your arms out like this. Listen to the music and move your legs with the music. It's easy and fun,\" said Lingling.",
