    "bookId": "g6b",
    "unit": "Unit 6 Anne wanted to dance",
    "sourceLine": 99,
    "sourceText": "*   Anne went to the dance floor and danced with Lingling. She stepped on Lingling's foot. \"I'm sorry,\" said Anne.（安妮走到舞池和玲玲一起跳舞。她踩到了玲玲的脚。“对不起，”安妮说。）",
