    "bookId": "g6b",
    "unit": "Unit 6 Anne wanted to dance",
    "sourceLine": 100,
    "sourceText": "*   \"It's OK. Let's do it again,\" smiled Lingling.（“没关系。让我们再做一次吧，”玲玲笑着说。）",
