    "bookId": "g3b",
    "unit": "Unit 10 Is she a driver?",
    "lineNumber": 145,
    "text": "*   Is he a worker? Yes, he is. The robot is a worker too. (他是一名工人吗？是的，他是。这个机器人也是一名工人。)"
